  <titlepage><titlepage-items /></titlepage>
  <preface xml:id="preface">
    <title>How this book teaches</title>
    <p>This is a Leaving Certificate Mathematics book built around doing mathematics. Explanations are short. Carefully sequenced examples and exercises do most of the teaching.</p>
    <p>New ideas are unpacked. Early questions change one feature at a time so that students can see what matters. Later questions remove the scaffolding, mix earlier ideas and ask students to transfer the mathematics to unfamiliar and examination-style situations.</p>
    <p>Ordinary Level is the core path. Higher Level extends that path rather than creating a second unrelated book.</p>
  </preface>
</frontmatter>
